        "5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53554f807f162a4c25c08e6c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "技能Pt的获取上限 <color=#ff6d26>+100</color>",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f4f8cfa9d9801724b32a1e27044674ce003dacc13fe4b3505725f29b82ee244",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "449",
        "6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:227c9707f86f166ecdb91d1c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "所有编成支援卡\\n将额外随机出现在1个训练中",
      "source_fingerprint": "dae883760a647da2d9746bc0ed4e65fee19fdfbe199395be8c1635c87b029b43",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "449",
        "7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1998989a235eae50b114266f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘，如果没有与采取靠后策略的赛马娘拉开一定以上的\\n距离，就会消耗耐力来提升速度。提升量会随着毅力的\\n提高而增加。发动率会随着智力的提高而增加。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6440e0bf216d6cdd6eb1e08e4af1f501822f5d8c9da208abb091fed44b32595f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "450",
        "10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:084612b898b1dee468e2cb60",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "当速度超过2000时，在最后冲刺阶段满足条件时\\n最高速度会提升。全开冲刺时所解放的\\n速度提升幅度会根据力量与带有「展现冲刺力」效果的技能而提升。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5652710651a0dd9847fcfd8066215c979a3b5dac5ba5a75d3aeb50566de1ea2f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "450",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33b43c32b3c685fb37dd4331",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "进入终盘后，会消耗耐力来提升最高速度。\\n提升量会随着速度和毅力的提高而增加。\\n如果耐力不足，会导致发动延迟或提升量减少。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9859280f6801be636ca7c5d0581def447a89535948d31209fa5394926d38f0a7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "450",
        "13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbf62b0034c92f621537c28b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛序盘到中盘，无法保持符合自身策略的\\n位置，并会消耗耐力来提升速度。\\n发动率会随着智力的提高而降低。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5f530895440ad50ab49f7b6dc8e1eb9ef3d49863e72067f4d5a750fcc4ee2c5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "450",
        "14"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:867155b50af80e90eb110ef3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "起跑时直到开始跑动的时间\\n超过一定时间时，会被判定为起跑慢。\\n部分技能效果可以缩短该时间。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6dcec7cb8b351bca5d11bc79e6491f109047593fca2ff8663ab6fd495fe93baf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "450",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3aacbe1e8f82bcd8a2c5ba0b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛序盘到中盘，如果策略为领跑的赛马娘之间\\n距离较近，就会消耗持耐力来提升速度。\\n提升量和发动时间会随着毅力的提高而增加。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b867a1bd08b508646d840ec0148a4de7d05b811317fb6ad8fe974aba69900043",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "450",
        "4"
      ]
    }
  ]
